{"title":"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Operation\" title=\"Operation\">operation</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d17950ad2ab63c764778b133f95a03dcf2969d57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\star$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/9/9793f37431f098843e57afb26a8d1923ec015f47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\star b = a+b+ab.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"14\" /> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a508d91a2ef4d543f52a57ceabd93827e9b2df3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\star x = 23,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/c/7dc22e8ecd41b9b99b767755fe41bd05d3e060cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x =$\" width=\"29\" height=\"8\" />\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/c/7fca7225123463e8169320ea40b76b9cb84e5c09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }3\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }4 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }5 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e7a5445747b389c61a27ec492b01434e256a13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\star x = 23 \\Longrightarrow 3+x+3x=23 \\Longrightarrow 4x = 20 \\Longrightarrow x=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"428\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa52a969bdc67f68d5bd053c316f18683e6c73b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D) \\ }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nAlternatively, note the resemblence to <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simon%27s_Favorite_Factoring_Trick\" title=\"Simon&#39;s Favorite Factoring Trick\">Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick</a>.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/c/66c8b8f108cd6b88a2ac5235d62be665fd36744e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a\\star b) + 1 = ab + a + b + 1 = (a + 1)(b + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"346\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/4/a648b0d411ac927b87be3f38388a5120fc770a4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24 = (x \\star 3) + 1 = (x + 1)(3 + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"261\" height=\"20\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/c/11cad106293828e9d4ff7ce261de740120fb43b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 1 = \\frac{24}4 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_1\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 1\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_3\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 3\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018113200\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2212/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3421:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018113200 and revision id 8895. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}